1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,850
在这个画出来的世界里，会发光的都是金子。
In the painted world, everything that shines is gold.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,650
可金子自己不会发光。
But gold has no light of its own.

3
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,950
有一天夜里，连太阳也熄了。
One night, even the sun went out.

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:16,150
于是一个女孩提起最后一盏灯，开始往山上走。
So a girl took the last lamp, and began to climb.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,750
她走到哪里，哪里的金子就想起了怎么发光。
Wherever she passed, the gold remembered how to shine.

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,100
她一走过，金子又睡着了。
Behind her, it fell asleep again.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,500
到了山顶，太阳只是一片冰冷的金箔。
At the top, the sun was only a cold disc of leaf.

8
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:31,200
她举起了灯。
And she lifted her lamp.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,150
金子不留自己的光。
Gold keeps no light of its own.

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,600
它只把得到的，还回去。
It only gives back what it is given.
